  "meta": {
    "description": "Agent tool. Writes the chosen timeslot and fulfilment to the DealerBook reservation (PATCH), submits the booking (POST bookings) and stores the DealerBook booking id and the six-letter reference code on the session. Inputs: sessionId (plumbed), slotId, mobility, notes. Returns {ok, confirmationCode (the reference code), bookingId, when, dealerName} or {ok:false, error}. Idempotent per session and slot."
